Feature addition: LOD system, bullet instancing, adaptive quality, interest management.

This commit modifies 12 files (+4713/-60 lines), spanning 3 game server, 3 tests, 2 TypeScript source.
This feature extends the Geometry Wars 3D codebase with new functionality. The implementation follows the project's established patterns and maintains compatibility with both single-player and multiplayer code paths where applicable.

Additional context from the commit body:
- LODManager: 3 LOD levels (full/icosahedron/billboard) with hysteresis
- BulletInstanceManager: GPU-instanced bullets (5 visual types, 2000 pool)
- AdaptiveQuality: auto-adjusts visual fidelity to maintain 60fps target
- PerformanceMonitor: rolling-window FPS tracking with renderer stats
- InterestManager: per-player AOI filtering for multiplayer sync optimization
- PriorityQueue: sync priority system (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW/NONE)
- 193 new tests passing (29 LOD + 38 bullet + 52 adaptive + 20 perf + 54 interest)

